### =========================================================================
### CUSTOMER REST API - TESTING COLLECTION (Spring Boot + JPA + DTO + HATEOAS)
### =========================================================================
# Requires VS Code "REST Client" extension to run directly.
# Base URL matches spring.port=8080 configuration

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@contentType = application/json

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. VERSION 1 & BACKWARD-COMPATIBILITY ENDPOINTS (/api/customers or /api/v1/customers)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 GET All Customers (Unfiltered)
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### 1.2 GET All Customers (Unfiltered via V1 versioned path)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/customers
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### 1.3 GET Customer by ID (Valid id: 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/customers/1
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### 1.4 GET Customer by ID (Invalid id: 999 - Expected: 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/customers/999
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### 1.5 POST Create New Customer (Expected: 201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/customers
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "customerCode": "C006",
  "fullName": "David Miller",
  "email": "david.miller@example.com",
  "phone": "+15550106",
  "address": "999 Broadway, Seattle, WA 98101"
}

###

### 1.6 POST Create Customer with Validation Errors (Expected: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/customers
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "customerCode": "C",
  "fullName": "D",
  "email": "invalid-email-format",
  "phone": "invalid-phone"
}

###

### 1.7 POST Create Customer with Duplicate Email (Expected: 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/customers
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "customerCode": "C007",
  "fullName": "Test Duplicate",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "phone": "+15559999"
}

###

### 1.8 PUT Update Existing Customer Fully (Expected: 200 OK)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/customers/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "customerCode": "C001",
  "fullName": "John Doe Updated",
  "email": "john.doe.updated@example.com",
  "phone": "+1-555-0101",
  "address": "123 Main St, New York, NY 10001",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

###

### 1.9 PATCH Update Customer Partially (Expected: 200 OK)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/customers/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "fullName": "John Doe Partially Updated"
}

###

### 1.10 DELETE Customer (Expected: 200 OK with confirmation message)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/v1/customers/6

###

### 1.11 GET Search Customers by Keyword (fullName, email, or customerCode)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/customers/search?keyword=john
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### 1.12 GET Filter Customers by Status (ACTIVE or INACTIVE)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/customers/status/ACTIVE
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### 1.13 GET Advanced Search with Multiple Parameters (Name, Email, and Status)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/customers/advanced-search?name=John&email=example&status=ACTIVE
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### 1.14 GET Customers with Pagination (Page 0, Size 2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/customers?page=0&size=2
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### 1.15 GET Customers with Sorting (Sorted by fullName descending)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/customers?sortBy=fullName&sortDir=desc
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### 1.16 GET Customers with Pagination and Sorting Combined
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/customers?page=0&size=2&sortBy=fullName&sortDir=asc
Accept: {{contentType}}


### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. VERSION 2 ENDPOINTS - INTEGRATING HATEOAS LINKS (/api/v2/customers)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 GET All Customers (v2 - Notice the hypermedia _links in the output)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v2/customers
Accept: {{contentType}}

###

### 2.2 GET Customer by ID (v2 - Notice the self and list links)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v2/customers/1
Accept: {{contentType}}
